    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "A payment referred to in subsection (1)(a) includes any expenses (including brokerage or commission) incurred directly in the purchase or acquisition by the company of its own shares"; the list of what the payment includes is open

