    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the person` BECAUSE "the person approved or authorised the purchase or acquisition of the company's own shares or the release of obligations, knowing that the company was not solvent"

§ `Section 76G: reduction of capital or profits on cancellation of repurchased shares`

-- (2): the total amount of the purchase price includes expenses incurred directly in the purchase and paid out of capital or profits under s 76F(1).
-- src:9043 | (2) For the purpose of subsection (1), the total amount of the
-- src:9044 | purchase price referred to in that subsection includes any expenses
-- src:9045 | (including brokerage or commission) incurred directly in the
-- src:9046 | purchase or acquisition of the shares of a company which is paid
-- src:9047 | out of the company’s capital or profits under section 76F(1).
@ref s 76G(2) (src:9043-9047)
GIVEN `the amount of the purchase price paid by the company for the shares cancelled` IS A NUMBER
      `the expenses (including brokerage or commission) incurred directly in the purchase or acquisition of the shares and paid out of the company's capital or profits under section 76F(1)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 76G(2) the total amount of the purchase price` MEANS
    `the amount of the purchase price paid by the company for the shares cancelled` PLUS `the expenses (including brokerage or commission) incurred directly in the purchase or acquisition of the shares and paid out of the company's capital or profits under section 76F(1)`

DECLARE `s 76G(1) reductions` HAS
    `s 76G(1) the reduction of the amount of the company's share capital` IS A NUMBER
    `s 76G(1) the reduction of the amount of the company's profits` IS A NUMBER

-- (1)(a), (b), (c): the share capital is reduced by the part of the price paid out of capital, the profits by the part paid out of profits; where both, "proportionately" is read as in proportion to what was paid out of each (fork F-G1).
-- src:9019 | 76G.—(1) Where under section 76C, 76D, 76DA or 76E, shares of
-- src:9020 | a company are purchased or acquired, and cancelled under
-- src:9021 | section 76B(5), the company must —
-- src:9026 | (a) reduce the amount of its share capital where the shares
-- src:9027 | were purchased or acquired out of the capital of the
-- src:9028 | company;
-- src:9030 | (b) reduce the amount of its profits where the shares were
-- src:9031 | purchased or acquired out of the profits of the company; or
-- src:9033 | (c) reduce the amount of its share capital and profits
-- src:9034 | proportionately where the shares were purchased or
-- src:9035 | acquired out of both the capital and the profits of the
-- src:9036 | company,
-- src:9038 | by the total amount of the purchase price paid by the company for the
-- src:9039 | shares cancelled.
@ref s 76G(1) (src:9019-9039)
GIVEN `the shares were purchased or acquired under section 76C, 76D, 76DA or 76E and cancelled under section 76B(5)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the part of the total amount of the purchase price paid out of the capital of the company` IS A NUMBER
      `the part of the total amount of the purchase price paid out of the profits of the company` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 76G(1) reductions`
`s 76G(1) the amounts by which the company must reduce its share capital and its profits` MEANS
    IF `the shares were purchased or acquired under section 76C, 76D, 76DA or 76E and cancelled under section 76B(5)`
    THEN JUST (`s 76G(1) reductions` OF `the part of the total amount of the purchase price paid out of the capital of the company`, `the part of the total amount of the purchase price paid out of the profits of the company`)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where under section 76C, 76D, 76DA or 76E, shares of a company are purchased or acquired, and cancelled under section 76B(5), the company must"; shares not so purchased and cancelled (shares held in treasury, for one) are outside the section {F-G2} {MR-b}

-- src:9019 | 76G.—(1) Where under section 76C, 76D, 76DA or 76E, shares of
-- src:9020 | a company are purchased or acquired, and cancelled under
-- src:9021 | section 76B(5), the company must —
-- src:9026 | (a) reduce the amount of its share capital where the shares
