-- src:9036 | company,
-- src:9038 | by the total amount of the purchase price paid by the company for the
-- src:9039 | shares cancelled.
@ref s 76G(1) (src:9019-9039)
GIVEN `the total amount of the purchase price paid by the company for the shares cancelled` IS A NUMBER
      `the part of the total amount of the purchase price paid out of the capital of the company` IS A NUMBER
      `the part of the total amount of the purchase price paid out of the profits of the company` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 76G(1) the parts paid out of capital and out of profits make up the total amount of the purchase price` MEANS
    (`the part of the total amount of the purchase price paid out of the capital of the company` PLUS `the part of the total amount of the purchase price paid out of the profits of the company`) EQUALS `the total amount of the purchase price paid by the company for the shares cancelled`

DECLARE `s 76G act` IS ONE OF
    `s 76G(1) reduce the amount of its share capital or its profits, or both, by the total amount of the purchase price paid for the shares cancelled`

